menu "ESP LV EAF Player"

    config ESP_LV_EAF_ENABLE_LVGL_ADAPTER
        bool "Enable LVGL adapter when LVGL is available"
        default y
        help
            Disable to build only the GUI-independent player even when another
            part of the application depends on LVGL.

    config ESP_LV_EAF_ENABLE_SW_JPEG
        bool "Enable Software JPEG Decoding"
        default y
        help
            Enable software JPEG decoder for EAF files with JPEG-encoded blocks.
            Disabling this option removes the software fallback. Hardware JPEG on
            supported SoCs remains available; unsupported dimensions or formats
            then return an error instead of falling back to software.

            You can disable this when all assets use Palette RLE/Huffman,
            Lossless or Bounded and contain no JPEG/JPEG Delta blocks.

endmenu
